docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Issues/linter-gap實務隱患.md:47:- **`isinstance(x, int)` 誤收 bool**(python `bool` 是 `int` 子類,`isinstance(True,int)==True`;config 讀 JSON 整數欄位用 `isinstance(v,int)` 守衛時 `{"depth":true}` 會穿透)。**真通則隱患、ruff/pylint 一般不 flag**,但**對 lumos 駁回=無未修實例**:反證者 grep 全 codebase,唯二讀 JSON config 整數守衛的地方(`_impact_load_config` `scripts/lumos:5573-5576`、`impact-hook.py:335`)**皆已加 `not isinstance(v,bool)`**,其餘 json.load 讀 str/dict/list 無整數守衛場景。來源:[Real Python isinstance](https://realpython.com/ref/builtin-functions/isinstance/)、[TIL bool subtype of int](https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/til-python-bool-subtype-int-wouter-donders)。(2026-07-05 dogfood)
